### Get All Active Jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs

### Get Single Job
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/1

### Filter Jobs (Location & Keyword)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/filter?location=New York&keyword=Developer

### Create a New Job (Requires Employer/Admin Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "title": "Junior Node.js Developer",
    "description": "We are looking for a backend expert...",
    "company_name": "Tech Corp",
    "location": "Remote",
    "salary_range": "$80k - $120k",
    "job_type": "full-time",
    "deadline": "2026-12-31"
}

### Publish Job to External Channels
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Close a Job (Deactivate)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/jobs/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


###
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/my-jobs
